  label Murkdeep
  zone map 1439
  note "Make sure you check if Murkdeep is already up in the water (if someone has previously failed the encounter or left the Greymist Hunter in the wave that he spawns with alive)"
  note "Kill the Greymist Warriors and Greymist Hunters in the camp"
  note "Move to the Bonfire in the center of the camp to start the Murkdeep encounter:"
  note "3 waves will spawn from the water, each after killing the previous wave: Wave 1 has 3 level 12-13 Greymist Coastrunners, Wave 2 has 2 level 15-16 Greymist Warriors, and Wave 3 has a level 19 Murkdeep and a level 16-17 Greymist Hunter. You can move away from the Bonfire to avoid aggroing the next wave"
  kill 10323 x1 quest 4740.1 -- Murkdeep (1)
